## Background

I'm running a training series teaching my team agentic coding — using the Codex
CLI and Claude Code routed through my company's internal AI gateway. Sessions run
~45 minutes. This HTML file is the reference guide people follow live and keep
afterward.

There are enough tabs that a flat list is overwhelming, so they're grouped into
three sections: **Orientation**, **Setup**, **Implementation**.

The course has a **through-line**: every participant builds their own small
application across Implementation, and the series ends in a **group showcase**
where each person demos what they built. Implementation tabs should keep pointing
at that.

